{
    "title": "King James Bible (KJV)",
    "description": "Welcome to the <b>King James Bible (KJV)</b> App: Your personal Bible app designed to bring the Holy Bible to your fingertips. This KJV Bible app offers an enriching and seamless reading experience in the revered King James Version (KJV).\r\n\r\n<b>Designed to help Christians</b> engage with and study scriptures daily, this app ensures that the King James Bible (KJV) is always within reach, no matter where you are. Use this KJV Bible app daily to inspire your thoughts with verses from the King James Version and take advantage of powerful study tools, including instant access to any book, chapter, or verse, custom bookmarks and notes, and easy sharing of KJV Bible verses with your loved ones.\r\n\r\nThis app represents our dedication to making the King James Version of the Bible publicly available to everyone and reaching people around the world through technology.\r\n\r\n<b>MAIN FEATURES</b>\r\n- Offline Access: Read the King James Bible (KJV) anytime, anywhere, even <b>without an internet connection</b>.\r\n- Progress Tracking: Continue your KJV Bible reading right where you left off and keep track of completed books and chapters.\r\n- Instant Navigation: Jump directly to any book, chapter, or verse in the Old or New Testament of the KJV Bible.\r\n- Enhanced Study Tools: <b>Add notes and colorful bookmarks</b> to verses and review your KJV Bible reading history.\r\n- Spread the Word: Create and share beautiful images of King James Bible (KJV) verses or build full PDFs within the app for seamless sharing.\r\n- Powerful Search Tools: Locate specific content in the King James Version of the Bible effortlessly.\r\n- Daily Inspiration: Start your day with a heartwarming <b>Verse of the Day</b> image from the King James Bible (KJV).\r\n- Home Screen Widget: Quick access to daily verses from the KJV Bible.\r\n- Personalization: Customize your KJV Bible reading experience with various themes and fonts.\r\n- Eye Comfort: Enable night mode for a relaxed King James Bible reading experience.\r\n- Backup and Sync: Seamlessly transfer your bookmarks, notes, and KJV Bible reading progress to another device.\r\n\r\n<b>KING JAMES TRANSLATIONS</b>\r\n- Old King James Bible (1611): Valued by those seeking a less altered version that is faithful to the Word of God.\r\n- King James Version (KJV): The most widely read Bible translation worldwide.\r\n- American King James Bible (AKJV): Featuring modernized words for contemporary readers.\r\n- Spanish (RV09), Portuguese (JFA), and French (LS1910): Accepted equivalents to the King James Bible.\r\n\r\n<b>OUR WORK</b>\r\nThis software has been crafted with care and dedication, standing as a testament to our belief in the transformative power of the King James Bible\u2019s teachings and our mission to make the KJV Bible more accessible to everyone.\r\n\r\n<b>JOIN OUR GROWING COMMUNITY</b>\r\nBe part of the millions of believers who have chosen our King James Bible (KJV) app for their daily readings of the Holy Bible. As we continue to expand, we offer multiple versions of the King James Bible (KJV) and support additional languages with equivalent Bibles.\r\n\r\n<b>FIND US IN OTHER LANGUAGES</b>\r\n- Spanish: Biblia KJV - Reina Valera\r\n- Portuguese: B\u00edblia KJV - Almeida JFA\r\n- French: Bible KJV - Louis Segond\r\n- Italian: Bibbia KJV - Riveduta (COOMING SOON)\r\n\r\nDownload the King James Bible (KJV) app and carry your own personal digital copy of the Holy Bible wherever you go! Follow us on Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/BibleAppKJV",
    "descriptionHTML": "Welcome to the <b>King James Bible (KJV)</b> App: Your personal Bible app designed to bring the Holy Bible to your fingertips. This KJV Bible app offers an enriching and seamless reading experience in the revered King James Version (KJV).<br><br><b>Designed to help Christians</b> engage with and study scriptures daily, this app ensures that the King James Bible (KJV) is always within reach, no matter where you are. Use this KJV Bible app daily to inspire your thoughts with verses from the King James Version and take advantage of powerful study tools, including instant access to any book, chapter, or verse, custom bookmarks and notes, and easy sharing of KJV Bible verses with your loved ones.<br><br>This app represents our dedication to making the King James Version of the Bible publicly available to everyone and reaching people around the world through technology.<br><br><b>MAIN FEATURES</b><br>- Offline Access: Read the King James Bible (KJV) anytime, anywhere, even <b>without an internet connection</b>.<br>- Progress Tracking: Continue your KJV Bible reading right where you left off and keep track of completed books and chapters.<br>- Instant Navigation: Jump directly to any book, chapter, or verse in the Old or New Testament of the KJV Bible.<br>- Enhanced Study Tools: <b>Add notes and colorful bookmarks</b> to verses and review your KJV Bible reading history.<br>- Spread the Word: Create and share beautiful images of King James Bible (KJV) verses or build full PDFs within the app for seamless sharing.<br>- Powerful Search Tools: Locate specific content in the King James Version of the Bible effortlessly.<br>- Daily Inspiration: Start your day with a heartwarming <b>Verse of the Day</b> image from the King James Bible (KJV).<br>- Home Screen Widget: Quick access to daily verses from the KJV Bible.<br>- Personalization: Customize your KJV Bible reading experience with various themes and fonts.<br>- Eye Comfort: Enable night mode for a relaxed King James Bible reading experience.<br>- Backup and Sync: Seamlessly transfer your bookmarks, notes, and KJV Bible reading progress to another device.<br><br><b>KING JAMES TRANSLATIONS</b><br>- Old King James Bible (1611): Valued by those seeking a less altered version that is faithful to the Word of God.<br>- King James Version (KJV): The most widely read Bible translation worldwide.<br>- American King James Bible (AKJV): Featuring modernized words for contemporary readers.<br>- Spanish (RV09), Portuguese (JFA), and French (LS1910): Accepted equivalents to the King James Bible.<br><br><b>OUR WORK</b><br>This software has been crafted with care and dedication, standing as a testament to our belief in the transformative power of the King James Bible\u2019s teachings and our mission to make the KJV Bible more accessible to everyone.<br><br><b>JOIN OUR GROWING COMMUNITY</b><br>Be part of the millions of believers who have chosen our King James Bible (KJV) app for their daily readings of the Holy Bible. As we continue to expand, we offer multiple versions of the King James Bible (KJV) and support additional languages with equivalent Bibles.<br><br><b>FIND US IN OTHER LANGUAGES</b><br>- Spanish: Biblia KJV - Reina Valera<br>- Portuguese: B\u00edblia KJV - Almeida JFA<br>- French: Bible KJV - Louis Segond<br>- Italian: Bibbia KJV - Riveduta (COOMING SOON)<br><br>Download the King James Bible (KJV) app and carry your own personal digital copy of the Holy Bible wherever you go! Follow us on Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/BibleAppKJV",
